{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06378","headline":"题神力师院 · 李颀","name":"题神力师院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大师神杰貌，五岳森禅房。\n坚持日月珠，豁见沧江长。\n随病拔诸苦，致身如法王。\n阶庭药草徧，饭食天花香。\n树色向高阁，昼阴横半墙。\n每闻第一义，心净琉璃光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}